title: =(processed OBJECT...)= -- the diff objects whose change-forest leaves are all marked processed
pid: a5cf0b33-3666-4b25-8560-4ed0826399ed
body: |2-
  The objects are those of =(leaves ...)= that are processed. A bare
  =(processed)= marks a headline that lists no object (one naming a
  single leaf). Absent
  when nothing is processed. A
  headline is processed when its =(processed ...)= names every object its
  =(leaves ...)= lists.
